### Document Business Rules and Exceptions

```typescript
// ✅ GOOD: Documents the business rule and its origin
// Business Rule: Orders under £10 don't incur platform fees
// This was introduced to encourage small transactions and matches
// competitor pricing (see PRD-2024-Q3 section 4.2)
const platformFee = orderAmount < 1000 ? 0 : calculatePlatformFee(orderAmount)

// ✅ GOOD: Explains a non-obvious edge case
// Edge case: Retainers can be paid even when order is disputed.
// This ensures ongoing work isn't blocked by disputes on unrelated orders.
// Approved by legal review 2024-11-15 (ticket: LEGAL-847)
if (order.status === 'disputed' && paymentType !== 'retainer') {
  return { error: 'Cannot process payment for disputed order' }
}
```

